OL,3,GNEWSAHow Hollyoaks storyline hopes to
OL,4,Ashine a light on grooming
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen soap star Brooke Vincent first
OL,7,Fheard of the upcoming grooming
OL,8,Fstoryline in Hollyoaks, she knew it was
OL,9,Fimportant story she wanted to help
OL,10,Ftell.
OL,12,FAfter leaving the role of Sophie
OL,13,FWebster on Coronation Street after 17
OL,14,Fyears, it promised the opportunity to
OL,15,Fplay a completely different role as
OL,16,Fteacher Abigail Matthews.
OL,18,F"When I did my audition, it was very
OL,19,Fmuch set in stone the kind of story it
OL,20,Fwas going to be," said Vincent who grew
OL,21,Fup in Tameside, Greater Manchester.
